Whenever one of your Dire Plague rips a soul it feels the inescapable coming of the end.

When this happens the darkness damage of the plague is a critical hit and all Dire Plagues in radius [1, 3, 5, 7, 9 (TL1-5)] around it (including itself) have their durations increased by [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] turns.

The duration increase may happen only once per turn.

If Crepuscule is currently active it fires an additional free beam at the target.

In addition the chance to rip a soul by Dire Plague increases by [30%, 46%, 59%, 70%, 80% (TL1-5)].
